/ Stage 10 (plan, Settings: "app.setting are … the app.id and such"): the app's name is its setting, so the one
/ place it lives is app.setting (how app.pr and the settings rows become one store is the coder's trace first).
Start
- set %!app.setting.name% = "Shop"
- assert %!app.name% equals "Shop", "the app answers its name from its setting"
- remove %!app.setting%
